    answer: "We integrate AV systems (home theater, whole-house audio, TV, streaming), lighting (smart switches and dimmers), and control systems that tie it all together. We also handle network infrastructure — the backbone that makes everything work reliably. Our focus is AV-centered smart home systems, not alarm or HVAC automation.",
  },
